  "description": "Deletes finished work rows from a product's SQL tables once they pass their retention window. The tables, their finished-time column and their finished statuses come from the product's storage register (.webority/data-placement.json); every column is checked against the live schema first, and every run is checked by the Webority.Jobs destructive-run guard. Purges that need code join the same run through IRetentionPurge.",
